{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1206823-hungarian-mirror-trap","id":1206823,"title":"Hungarian Mirror Trap","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-14T01:33:31-07:00","id":1206823,"title":"Hungarian Mirror Trap","content":"Couldn't find anything about it, so I figured I'd ask around and see what people thought - If a mage would want to reproduce the Hungarian Mirror Trap from Sorcerer's Apprentice - essentially trapping an individual in a parallel world that is easy to get out of by going through your own reflection (which naturally gets shattered after they fall into the trap), what might you say would be required to do so?<br /> <br /> Or even just a regular mirror trap, where you thrust someone into the mirror and leave them there, pounding to get out of the glass :P I like both options.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1513,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1513-jakondite","user":"Jakondite","date":". 04-14-2018, 04:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1513-jakondite","name":"Jakondite","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"413"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-14T03:14:21-07:00","id":1206837,"title":"","content":"To trap someone in a pocket realm, I'd say Correspondence 4, Life 3 (transfer the living pattern through a mirror into the &quot;mirror world&quot;, not the same as the mirror realm). It's probably a good idea to ward that space before you trap someone in there (depending on their potential power).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13221-thevarulfen","name":"TheVarulfen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-14T07:42:39-07:00","id":1206877,"title":"","content":"Alternatively, you could use Spirit 4 to open a gate to an Umbral Realm where the main difference is being a backwards version of the material world. The victim would be about as capable of leaving as they would be getting back from anywhere in the Umbra (which, for a regular mortal, is probably not very).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-14T11:11:18-07:00","id":1206953,"title":"","content":"You could even try doing that on a sleeper .<br /> Just beware of the consequences of paradox breaking your mirror or pulling things you dont want from it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23946-randyrando","name":"RandyRando","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23946_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}